<section class="panel">
  <h2 class="panel__title">Store permissions</h2>
  <p class="panel__copy">
    Reconnect <strong><%= store.store_name || shop %></strong> to approve updated
    Shopify permissions, including inventory location access.
    Your store connections and saved settings are kept.
